{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Cybersickness.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Cybersickness.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"cybersickness cybersickness","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Cybersickness.md","fileName":"Cybersickness.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Cybersickness","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 13:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[XR Environments]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["XR Environments","Visual Display","Feedback Compliance","Latency","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Cybersickness.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Cybersickness.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"cybersickness cybersickness","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Cybersickness.md","fileName":"Cybersickness.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Cybersickness","heading":"Cybersickness","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Cybersickness is discomfort associated with virtual or three-dimensional systems and is symptomatically similar to motion sickness. It is also called simulator sickness or VR sickness in particular contexts.\n\nA leading explanation is conflict among sensory signals. For example, a [[Visual Display]] may indicate movement while the vestibular system indicates that the body is stationary. Poor [[Feedback Compliance]], [[Latency]], low update rates, or misregistration can intensify the mismatch.\n\nSymptoms can include headache, blurred vision, dizziness, disorientation, and nausea. Because susceptibility differs among people, evaluation should measure user comfort and provide rest or stopping procedures rather than relying only on system performance.","tags":["baby"],"links":["XR Environments","Visual Display","Feedback Compliance","Latency","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Cybersickness.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Cybersickness.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"cybersickness cybersickness","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Cybersickness.md","fileName":"Cybersickness.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Cybersickness","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["XR Environments","Visual Display","Feedback Compliance","Latency","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}